==Combo Effects==
Combo effects are generally universal, but can rarely be limited to certain units. As of [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]], the only unit-specific Combos are the [[:Category:Nyanko Rangers|Nyanko Rangers]]' Combos, which exclusively affect Nyanko Rangers.

===Scaling===
These effects come in varying sizes: Sm (weakest), M, L and XL (strongest). Some effect and size combinations are unimplemented, including most XL effects.

'''Unit Attack Up''': Active units have increased attack power.

'''Unit Defense Up''': Active units have increased defensive power.

'''Unit Speed Up''': Active units have faster movement.

'''Cannon Start Level Up''': Begins the stage with the [[Cat Cannon]] partially charged.

'''Worker Start Level Up''': [[Worker Cat]] begins the stage at a higher level. The battle item "Rich Cat" has priority over this skill.

'''Starting Money Up''': Begin the stage with money ready in your wallet.

'''Cannon Attack Up''': Damage to enemies from the Cat Cannon is increased.

'''Cannon Recharge Up''': Cat Cannon will recharge at a faster rate. There is a minimum recharge time of 950f or 31.67 seconds that cannot be shortened further through Combos.

'''Worker Max Up''': Increases the size of your wallet.

'''Base Defense  Up''': Increases the [[Cat Base]]'s health.

'''Research Power Up''': Amount of time before a Cat Unit can be deployed again is decreased. There is a minimum recharge time of 60f or 2 seconds that cannot be shortened further through Combos.

'''Bounty Up''': Bonus money received from defeating enemies is increased.

'''XP Rewards''': XP received upon clearing a stage is increased.

'''"Strong" Effects Up''': Units who are "Strong" against certain enemies have their damage increased even further, and damage received decreased vs. that type.

'''"Massive Damage" Effects Up''': Units with "Massive Damage" against enemies have damage increased even further against that enemy type.

'''"Resistant" Effects Up''': Units with "Resistant" against enemies have damage received from that enemy type decreased even further.

'''"Knockback" Effects Up''': Units with "Knockback" abilities against enemies have the distance of their knockback effects increased vs. that enemy type.

'''"Slow" Effects Up''': Units with "Slow" abilities against enemies have the duration of their Slow effect increased vs. that enemy type.

'''"Freeze" Effects Up''': Units with "Freeze" abilities against enemies have the duration of their Freeze effect increased vs. that enemy type.

'''"Weaken" Effects Up''': Units with "Weaken" abilities against enemies have the duration of their Weaken effect increased vs. that enemy type.

'''"Strengthen" Effects Up''': Units with "Strengthen" abilities will be able to increase their attack power even further beyond their normal amount.

'''"Critical Chance Up"''': Units with Critical Attack will gain higher critical rate.

'''"Cost Down"''': [[:Category:Nyanko Rangers|Nyanko Rangers]] will cost less to deploy.

'''"EVA Angel Killer" Effects Up''': Units with "EVA Angel Killer" abilities will deal even more damage to and take even less damage from [[:Category:EVA Angel Enemies|EVA Angels]].

'''"Witch Killer" Effects Up''': Units with "Witch Killer" abilities will deal even more damage to and take even less damage from [[:Category:Witch Enemies|Witches]].

