===Non-scaling===
These effects give units abilities or situational buffs, and do not have different sizes.

'''"Kaijin Slayer"''': [[:Category:Nyanko Rangers|Nyanko Rangers]] will deal 2.5x damage against and take 0.4x damage from [[:Category:Kaijin Enemies|Kaijins]].

'''"Wave Immunity"''': Nyanko Rangers are granted the "Immune to Waves" ability.

'''"Surge Immunity"''': Nyanko Rangers are granted the "Immune to Surge" ability.

